[
  {
    "page_index": 3,
    "source_page": 1,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 4829,
    "id": "text_7bf8bf5f770d4051",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 280,
      "y1": 157,
      "x2": 669,
      "y2": 320
    },
    "source_text": "IS THIS COLLUSION BY\nORDER OF HIS MAJESTY\nTHE EMPEROR?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 3,
    "source_page": 1,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 6169,
    "id": "text_6914f0757ac649e3",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 103,
      "y1": 1497,
      "x2": 507,
      "y2": 1651
    },
    "source_text": "IT'S LIKE AN EVENT THAT\nALWAYS HAPPENS DURING\nTHE STORM SEASON."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 3,
    "source_page": 1,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 7187,
    "id": "text_1740c2d6466e4a18",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 398,
      "y1": 2515,
      "x2": 834,
      "y2": 2743
    },
    "source_text": "IT'S SOMETHING\nYOU'LL HAVE TO DO\nIF I'M NOT AROUND\nIN THE FUTURE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 4,
    "source_page": 1,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 8120,
    "id": "text_acf31fc897e547cc",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 239,
      "y1": 577,
      "x2": 667,
      "y2": 761
    },
    "source_text": "LET'S GO. WE HAVE TO\nHEAD TO THE ENTERED\nCOORDINATES."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 8,
    "source_page": 3,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 536,
    "id": "text_b6a0ecc347fa42dd",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 373,
      "y1": 536,
      "x2": 776,
      "y2": 697
    },
    "source_text": "IF I WANT TO\nKILL KINUAN,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 8,
    "source_page": 3,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 1750,
    "id": "text_c863106b54514fbe",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 238,
      "y1": 1750,
      "x2": 666,
      "y2": 1890
    },
    "source_text": "TODAY MIGHT BE\nTHAT OPPORTUNITY."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 9,
    "source_page": 3,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 4704,
    "id": "text_4a00225aabd3492e",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 105,
      "y1": 2304,
      "x2": 475,
      "y2": 2470
    },
    "source_text": "RIGHT NOW,\nKINUAN'S-"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 9,
    "source_page": 3,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 4899,
    "id": "text_5e14794838554248",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 334,
      "y1": 2499,
      "x2": 573,
      "y2": 2624
    },
    "source_text": "LUKA,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 10,
    "source_page": 3,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 6286,
    "id": "text_c556950871ee464f",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 358,
      "y1": 614,
      "x2": 855,
      "y2": 773
    },
    "source_text": "THE HARDSHIPS AND CONFUSION\nYOU'RE EXPERIENCING ARE A PATH\nI'VE ALREADY WALKED."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 10,
    "source_page": 3,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 7931,
    "id": "text_0ca26d0b09224690",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 216,
      "y1": 2259,
      "x2": 688,
      "y2": 2445
    },
    "source_text": "TRUST ME, THE PATH\nOF A WATCHER IS YOUR\nBEST OPTION."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 11,
    "source_page": 3,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 8827,
    "id": "text_7dec014ccdae4f15",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 68,
      "y1": 568,
      "x2": 487,
      "y2": 750
    },
    "source_text": "EVEN IF THE PROCESS\nDIFFERS FROM YOUR\nINTENTIONS,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 11,
    "source_page": 3,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 9802,
    "id": "text_a14271ffe6bd4623",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 451,
      "y1": 1543,
      "x2": 849,
      "y2": 1723
    },
    "source_text": "I WILL\nEVENTUALLY BECOME\nA WATCHER."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 11,
    "source_page": 3,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 10463,
    "id": "text_74f15037ab844180",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 235,
      "y1": 2204,
      "x2": 666,
      "y2": 2352
    },
    "source_text": "HMM... GIVE IT YOUR\nBEST EFFORT."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 12,
    "source_page": 3,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 11713,
    "id": "text_c30e8c8398964279",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 171,
      "y1": 1725,
      "x2": 736,
      "y2": 1919
    },
    "source_text": "FOR THE RECORD,\nI BECAME A WATCHER AFTER\nKILLING MY PREDECESSOR."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 13,
    "source_page": 3,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 15413,
    "id": "text_3827e067369940a1",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 369,
      "y1": 566,
      "x2": 809,
      "y2": 754
    },
    "source_text": "OF COURSE,\nYOUR CASE AND MINE\nARE DIFFERENT."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 15,
    "source_page": 5,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 93,
    "id": "text_145cf1f1a2964508",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 215,
      "y1": 93,
      "x2": 691,
      "y2": 356
    },
    "source_text": "BUT EVEN\nIF YOU WERE TO\nTARGET ME,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 15,
    "source_page": 5,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 2594,
    "id": "text_b7326270c90f4119",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 184,
      "y1": 2594,
      "x2": 733,
      "y2": 2825
    },
    "source_text": "IT WOULDN'T BE AN\nUNFAMILIAR SITUATION\nFOR ME."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 16,
    "source_page": 5,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 3575,
    "id": "text_971b009930054418",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 59,
      "y1": 542,
      "x2": 476,
      "y2": 739
    },
    "source_text": "YOU HAVE TOO\nMANY THOUGHTS\nRIGHT NOW."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 16,
    "source_page": 5,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 4775,
    "id": "text_26051b82908c42df",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 339,
      "y1": 1742,
      "x2": 850,
      "y2": 1991
    },
    "source_text": "IF YOU'RE\nCOVERED IN IMPURITIES,\nYOUR DECISION-MAKING\nSLOWS DOWN."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 17,
    "source_page": 5,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 5741,
    "id": "text_0d9b7644a4814bc8",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 174,
      "y1": 308,
      "x2": 738,
      "y2": 507
    },
    "source_text": "SOME SAY THAT\nIMPURITIES ARE WHAT MAKE\nA PERSON STRONG."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 18,
    "source_page": 5,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 7567,
    "id": "text_d5ee0d8a1c0e4307",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 54,
      "y1": 419,
      "x2": 426,
      "y2": 558
    },
    "source_text": "THAT'S ABSOLUTE\nNONSENSE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 18,
    "source_page": 5,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 7783,
    "id": "text_6e89e2114fec4986",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 268,
      "y1": 635,
      "x2": 630,
      "y2": 735
    },
    "source_text": "THINK ABOUT IT."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 18,
    "source_page": 5,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 8954,
    "id": "text_a13f48f237f14675",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 362,
      "y1": 1806,
      "x2": 859,
      "y2": 2062
    },
    "source_text": "WHO BENEFITS\nTHE MOST WHEN YOU\nSHOULDER THOSE\nIMPURITIES?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 19,
    "source_page": 5,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 9485,
    "id": "text_6f0d776a2fe04982",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 41,
      "y1": 1049,
      "x2": 492,
      "y2": 1259
    },
    "source_text": "ISN'T THE PERSON\nWHO PUSHED DUTY\nAND RESPONSIBILITY\nONTO YOU,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 19,
    "source_page": 5,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 11068,
    "id": "text_acb5836f39a948fd",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 408,
      "y1": 2632,
      "x2": 842,
      "y2": 2807
    },
    "source_text": "FORCING YOU TO\nACCEPT LOSS AND\nSACRIFICE,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 19,
    "source_page": 5,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 12552,
    "id": "text_41af908d76e84f20",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 199,
      "y1": 4116,
      "x2": 706,
      "y2": 4319
    },
    "source_text": "THE VERY ONE\nWHO SHACKLED YOU WITH\nTHOSE IMPURITIES?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 20,
    "source_page": 5,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 14538,
    "id": "text_a1813f1dfa6a4e96",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 83,
      "y1": 1583,
      "x2": 791,
      "y2": 1724
    },
    "source_text": "SUCH SWEET WORDS."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 21,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 17,
    "id": "text_b47d3bfa1fe54962",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 158,
      "y1": 17,
      "x2": 748,
      "y2": 162
    },
    "source_text": "PROTECT\nTHE KUSTORIA FAMILY."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 21,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 1287,
    "id": "text_454b97c92b7a4dc7",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 287,
      "y1": 1287,
      "x2": 885,
      "y2": 1493
    },
    "source_text": "IF I SET ASIDE THIS\nPREMISE, EVERYTHING\nBECOMES CLEAR."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 22,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 1872,
    "id": "text_c53c10f9d7e842dd",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 34,
      "y1": 1125,
      "x2": 481,
      "y2": 1353
    },
    "source_text": "I COULD REPORT\nIVAN'S DEVIATION\nTO HIS MAJESTY\nTHE EMPEROR,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 22,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 2580,
    "id": "text_289187ba8b3d462d",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 302,
      "y1": 1833,
      "x2": 900,
      "y2": 2018
    },
    "source_text": "AND ACT AS AN IMPERIAL\nSPY WITHIN KUSTORIA AND\nTHE MILITARY."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 22,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 3576,
    "id": "text_13df27518daf4b1b",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 51,
      "y1": 2829,
      "x2": 850,
      "y2": 2973
    },
    "source_text": "I JUST NEED TO ACT AS A SPY\nFOR THE IMPERIAL FAMILY."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 23,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 4414,
    "id": "text_f47125e2a405480d",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 434,
      "y1": 838,
      "x2": 900,
      "y2": 973
    },
    "source_text": "BUT THE PROBLEM\nI'VE ALWAYS CARRIED"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 23,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 5214,
    "id": "text_fb02ea4968da41c0",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 175,
      "y1": 1638,
      "x2": 747,
      "y2": 1810
    },
    "source_text": "IS THAT I AM\nBECOMING WEAK."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 23,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 6174,
    "id": "text_ac47181943fb4047",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 4,
      "y1": 2598,
      "x2": 554,
      "y2": 2806
    },
    "source_text": "THE IMPURITY OF\nFAMILY, THE IMPURITY\nOF HUMANITY,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 23,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 6427,
    "id": "text_fbb280670c0b41da",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 193,
      "y1": 2851,
      "x2": 778,
      "y2": 3065
    },
    "source_text": "I WAS SHARP\nWHEN THOSE DIDN'T\nEXIST WITHIN ME."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 24,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 6976,
    "id": "text_262b8ec9af7641c7",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 96,
      "y1": 1025,
      "x2": 810,
      "y2": 1281
    },
    "source_text": "THE ONE WHO PUT\nALL THESE IMPURITIES\nON MY BACK WAS"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 24,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 9215,
    "id": "text_e1436f58ebad4e35",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 105,
      "y1": 3264,
      "x2": 900,
      "y2": 3912
    },
    "source_text": "HEILLAS KUSTORIA."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 25,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 10087,
    "id": "text_37338043c32c4f2b",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 103,
      "y1": 873,
      "x2": 436,
      "y2": 1031
    },
    "source_text": "LET'S WALK\nFROM HERE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 25,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 11644,
    "id": "text_73f6fccca7924e0e",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 390,
      "y1": 2430,
      "x2": 739,
      "y2": 2571
    },
    "source_text": "AAH, KEEP YOUR\nFACE COVERED."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 25,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 12646,
    "id": "text_88d2032e11c7487a",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 195,
      "y1": 3432,
      "x2": 704,
      "y2": 3602
    },
    "source_text": "THEY'LL PULL THE TRIGGER\nWITHOUT HESITATION IF THEY\nRECOGNIZE YOU."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 26,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 13551,
    "id": "text_ce9181ff4b4c4a0e",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 227,
      "y1": 581,
      "x2": 857,
      "y2": 759
    },
    "source_text": "LUKA, I KNOW YOUR SITUATION,\nBUT YOU'D BETTER KEEP YOUR WITS\nABOUT YOU."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 26,
    "source_page": 6,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 15343,
    "id": "text_addaab1831604537",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 48,
      "y1": 2373,
      "x2": 519,
      "y2": 2594
    },
    "source_text": "THE IMPERIAL FAMILY WILL\nLAUNCH A MASSIVE SWEEP\nDURING THIS STORM\nSEASON."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 27,
    "source_page": 7,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 559,
    "id": "text_f17657718be54fa7",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 368,
      "y1": 559,
      "x2": 847,
      "y2": 759
    },
    "source_text": "MANY KEY FIGURES\nIN THE MILITARY WILL\nDIE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 27,
    "source_page": 7,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 1565,
    "id": "text_fb465d16e52a4c7e",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 258,
      "y1": 1565,
      "x2": 649,
      "y2": 1765
    },
    "source_text": "HANDLE THIS\nWISELY,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 29,
    "source_page": 8,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 1449,
    "id": "text_967e297f5a404eb0",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 273,
      "y1": 739,
      "x2": 625,
      "y2": 935
    },
    "source_text": "YOUNG\nWATCHER."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 30,
    "source_page": 8,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 6294,
    "id": "text_ffad70aeb2724172",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 243,
      "y1": 2295,
      "x2": 662,
      "y2": 2429
    },
    "source_text": "THE SEASON OF\nSTORMS HAS BEGUN."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 31,
    "source_page": 8,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 8347,
    "id": "text_b3e4357026e64c8f",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 82,
      "y1": 618,
      "x2": 507,
      "y2": 753
    },
    "source_text": "THE TIME TO DECIDE\nIS APPROACHING."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 32,
    "source_page": 8,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 10288,
    "id": "text_5838f4b185094a62",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 260,
      "y1": 309,
      "x2": 644,
      "y2": 454
    },
    "source_text": "LET'S ORGANIZE\nMY THOUGHTS."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 33,
    "source_page": 8,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 10977,
    "id": "text_66570cfdc6d84df2",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 213,
      "y1": 944,
      "x2": 691,
      "y2": 1154
    },
    "source_text": "I HAD\nNO OPPORTUNITY\nTO KILL KINUAN."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 34,
    "source_page": 8,
    "slice_index": 6,
    "source_y": 12486,
    "id": "text_9dc5436807f04fb6",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 126,
      "y1": 942,
      "x2": 673,
      "y2": 1180
    },
    "source_text": "IVAN ALSO FAILED TO\nCREATE AN OPPORTUNITY\nFOR ME TO ASSASSINATE\nKINUAN."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 34,
    "source_page": 8,
    "slice_index": 6,
    "source_y": 13690,
    "id": "text_0648a7eb144c43c1",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 323,
      "y1": 2146,
      "x2": 821,
      "y2": 2328
    },
    "source_text": "COOPERATION WITH\nIVAN MUST BE EXCLUDED\nFOR NOW."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 34,
    "source_page": 8,
    "slice_index": 6,
    "source_y": 15141,
    "id": "text_6c8b1d36afa64609",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 259,
      "y1": 3597,
      "x2": 641,
      "y2": 3770
    },
    "source_text": "THE ONLY\nTHING LEFT FOR\nME IS..."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 36,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 216,
    "id": "text_bb17f5c6bc4d4ce0",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 104,
      "y1": 216,
      "x2": 746,
      "y2": 502
    },
    "source_text": "STARTING FROM\nTHE THIRD WEEK OF\nTHE UPCOMING STORM\nSEASON, NEMESIS WILL INCITE\nRIOTS AND TERRORISM IN\nTHE UPPER SECTOR."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 36,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 643,
    "id": "text_cd0de512b4e44670",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 441,
      "y1": 643,
      "x2": 835,
      "y2": 777
    },
    "source_text": "MANY NOBLES\nWILL DIE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 37,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 1680,
    "id": "text_eb6676fbd9a24b84",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 100,
      "y1": 749,
      "x2": 690,
      "y2": 950
    },
    "source_text": "TAKING ADVANTAGE OF THAT\nCHAOS, THE IMPERIAL FAMILY\nWILL ALSO ELIMINATE KEY\nMILITARY FIGURES"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 37,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 2874,
    "id": "text_a932a2049c294099",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 185,
      "y1": 1943,
      "x2": 715,
      "y2": 2091
    },
    "source_text": "USING THE SHADOWS OF\nTHE IMPERIAL FAMILY"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 37,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 4513,
    "id": "text_19e88904b93c4e88",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 204,
      "y1": 3582,
      "x2": 695,
      "y2": 3724
    },
    "source_text": "WILL THEY TARGET\nTHE KUSTORIA FAMILY?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 38,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 5549,
    "id": "text_15602af33223473b",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 210,
      "y1": 663,
      "x2": 693,
      "y2": 808
    },
    "source_text": "IS HEILLAS A TARGET\nFOR ELIMINATION?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 38,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 6501,
    "id": "text_d407d84da3784001",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 287,
      "y1": 1615,
      "x2": 809,
      "y2": 1787
    },
    "source_text": "NO, IS AN ASSASSINATION\nEVEN POSSIBLE IN THE FIRST\nPLACE?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 39,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 7437,
    "id": "text_702abd631d79492f",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 195,
      "y1": 229,
      "x2": 706,
      "y2": 438
    },
    "source_text": "THE ONLY THING\nLEFT FOR ME IS TO\nCAST HEILLAS ASIDE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 40,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 9320,
    "id": "text_8ce2f4259ad84bf6",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 111,
      "y1": 232,
      "x2": 638,
      "y2": 451
    },
    "source_text": "DID HEILLAS TIE ME\nTO THE FAMILY JUST\nTO USE ME?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 40,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 9683,
    "id": "text_c631c08bd1e84888",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 328,
      "y1": 595,
      "x2": 804,
      "y2": 757
    },
    "source_text": "IF IT WAS A PLAN,\nSINCE WHEN?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 40,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 10891,
    "id": "text_01ced15111364fde",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 227,
      "y1": 1803,
      "x2": 671,
      "y2": 1965
    },
    "source_text": "OR WAS IT JUST\nA COINCIDENCE?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 41,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 11846,
    "id": "text_b1a161b8ef4640e9",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 97,
      "y1": 358,
      "x2": 491,
      "y2": 502
    },
    "source_text": "WHOM SHOULD\nI TRUST,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 41,
    "source_page": 10,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 13462,
    "id": "text_8834d115af684008",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 309,
      "y1": 1974,
      "x2": 777,
      "y2": 2195
    },
    "source_text": "AND\nWHOM SHOULD\nI BETRAY?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 43,
    "source_page": 11,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 1194,
    "id": "text_876e5912229e436c",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 376,
      "y1": 1194,
      "x2": 715,
      "y2": 1350
    },
    "source_text": "MUST YOU\nLEAVE NOW?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 43,
    "source_page": 11,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 1413,
    "id": "text_37b5219b13364797",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 71,
      "y1": 1413,
      "x2": 523,
      "y2": 1676
    },
    "source_text": "WE DON'T KNOW\nWHEN THE NO-FLY\nORDER WILL BE\nISSUED."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 43,
    "source_page": 11,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 2541,
    "id": "text_43565f2396c041b1",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 297,
      "y1": 2541,
      "x2": 609,
      "y2": 2739
    },
    "source_text": "SOMETHING\nIMPORTANT\nCAME UP,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 43,
    "source_page": 11,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 2799,
    "id": "text_2a4ab1c43b614e0b",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 470,
      "y1": 2799,
      "x2": 845,
      "y2": 2945
    },
    "source_text": "AND I CANNOT\nBE ABSENT."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 44,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 158,
    "id": "text_6d72871f1ac64bce",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 316,
      "y1": 158,
      "x2": 841,
      "y2": 344
    },
    "source_text": "WHILE I AM AWAY,\nYOU ARE THE ONE IN CHARGE\nOF THE MANSION, LUKA."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 44,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 506,
    "id": "text_3b26c2856b9a4c44",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 65,
      "y1": 506,
      "x2": 549,
      "y2": 686
    },
    "source_text": "I'VE TOLD THE PEOPLE TO\nPRIORITIZE YOUR ORDERS\nOVER EVA'S."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 44,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 2871,
    "id": "text_2a2d0898435440f1",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 100,
      "y1": 2871,
      "x2": 480,
      "y2": 2978
    },
    "source_text": "...UNDERSTOOD."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 44,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 3430,
    "id": "text_6db015c8fc2e4637",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 265,
      "y1": 3430,
      "x2": 650,
      "y2": 3654
    },
    "source_text": "LUKAIS\nKUSTORIA,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 45,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 5090,
    "id": "text_6569b2246674463e",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 221,
      "y1": 2041,
      "x2": 685,
      "y2": 2207
    },
    "source_text": "PLEASE REMEMBER\nMY REQUEST."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 46,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 6062,
    "id": "text_c2a94c2ebeaa4d8f",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 118,
      "y1": 205,
      "x2": 548,
      "y2": 391
    },
    "source_text": "HEILLAS PROBABLY\nDOESN'T KNOW I'M\nA WATCHER."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 46,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 6322,
    "id": "text_67f561665e124479",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 349,
      "y1": 465,
      "x2": 781,
      "y2": 671
    },
    "source_text": "NO MATTER\nHOW GREAT HIS\nINSIGHT IS,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 46,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 7368,
    "id": "text_974b02f0ef574e7f",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 149,
      "y1": 1511,
      "x2": 762,
      "y2": 1770
    },
    "source_text": "IT'S HARD TO\nREALIZE THE EXISTENCE OF\nTHE BIZARRE DUTY OF AN IMPERIAL\nWATCHER WITH LIMITED\nINFORMATION."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 47,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 8474,
    "id": "text_4c76bc19f1754bd9",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 199,
      "y1": 235,
      "x2": 694,
      "y2": 428
    },
    "source_text": "BUT HEILLAS MUST\nHAVE FELT SOMETHING\nFROM ME."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 47,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 9435,
    "id": "text_02e62aa86f2644b0",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 0,
      "y1": 1196,
      "x2": 900,
      "y2": 1543
    },
    "source_text": "THE STRANGE\nCOEXISTENCE WITH\nKINUAN,\nACHIEVEMENTS\nTOO GREAT FOR A CADET\nTO AMASS,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 47,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 10335,
    "id": "text_db2ddda7e39144ab",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 0,
      "y1": 2096,
      "x2": 889,
      "y2": 2393
    },
    "source_text": "INTERACTION WITH\nTHE CRIMSON CROWN\nPRINCE, FRANSEK,\nEVEN ARGATHA'S\nTRUST WHICH IS LIKE\nAN OBSESSION..."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 48,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 11297,
    "id": "text_ed584620722f4ffe",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 101,
      "y1": 554,
      "x2": 550,
      "y2": 771
    },
    "source_text": "IT'S ONLY\nCIRCUMSTANTIAL\nEVIDENCE,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 48,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 11628,
    "id": "text_11e9d9b8d6d8473d",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 292,
      "y1": 885,
      "x2": 812,
      "y2": 1124
    },
    "source_text": "BUT HEILLAS KNOWS\nTHAT I'M OPERATING IN\nA REALM HE DOESN'T\nUNDERSTAND."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 48,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 12653,
    "id": "text_2d46e4919ce1477d",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 149,
      "y1": 1910,
      "x2": 754,
      "y2": 2147
    },
    "source_text": "HE THOUGHT\nI WAS THE ONE WHO COULD\nPROTECT THE FAMILY EVEN\nIF HE FAILED."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 48,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 13890,
    "id": "text_7349ca5b0c854342",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 432,
      "y1": 3147,
      "x2": 806,
      "y2": 3303
    },
    "source_text": "HEILLAS TOOK\nA GAMBLE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 49,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 14855,
    "id": "text_3b0005423732475a",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 236,
      "y1": 638,
      "x2": 666,
      "y2": 845
    },
    "source_text": "HEILLAS IS\nUSING ME."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 49,
    "source_page": 12,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 15745,
    "id": "text_b16902fb12fd4fc7",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 230,
      "y1": 1528,
      "x2": 670,
      "y2": 1676
    },
    "source_text": "THIS STATEMENT IS\nNOT INCORRECT."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 50,
    "source_page": 13,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 434,
    "id": "text_3cf525860dfc4d0e",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 0,
      "y1": 434,
      "x2": 725,
      "y2": 672
    },
    "source_text": "THE AFFECTION\nHE SHOWED ME PROBABLY\nWASN'T ENTIRELY A LIE,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 50,
    "source_page": 13,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 1006,
    "id": "text_a90fe7a08fe04ade",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 191,
      "y1": 1006,
      "x2": 900,
      "y2": 1195
    },
    "source_text": "BUT THERE IS DEFINITELY\nCALCULATION MIXED IN."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 50,
    "source_page": 13,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 1639,
    "id": "text_981a08550de743fe",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 26,
      "y1": 1639,
      "x2": 895,
      "y2": 1870
    },
    "source_text": "WHAT KIND OF DECISION\nWILL HEILLAS MAKE?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 52,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 3399,
    "id": "text_fb3c56167bdd42be",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 560,
      "y1": 543,
      "x2": 831,
      "y2": 654
    },
    "source_text": "LUKAIS."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 53,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 5018,
    "id": "text_87acccc1127d42a6",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 48,
      "y1": 150,
      "x2": 541,
      "y2": 348
    },
    "source_text": "MOTHER, I KNOW\nYOU HAVE GRIEVANCES\nAGAINST ME."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 53,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 5339,
    "id": "text_56e3bcaa60bd49dc",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 317,
      "y1": 471,
      "x2": 771,
      "y2": 619
    },
    "source_text": "BUT AS THE ACTING\nPATRIARCH-"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 53,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 6215,
    "id": "text_1782ee531b8b4099",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 456,
      "y1": 1347,
      "x2": 865,
      "y2": 1542
    },
    "source_text": "THAT'S NOT\nWHAT I WANT TO\nTALK ABOUT."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 54,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 7011,
    "id": "text_437808cfef0b4f50",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 54,
      "y1": 126,
      "x2": 350,
      "y2": 234
    },
    "source_text": "HEILLAS..."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 54,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 7209,
    "id": "text_c2f44d42bcf64a5c",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 205,
      "y1": 324,
      "x2": 671,
      "y2": 527
    },
    "source_text": "WILL HE BE ABLE TO\nRETURN TO MY SIDE\nALIVE?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 54,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 9083,
    "id": "text_852b136b30504037",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 342,
      "y1": 2198,
      "x2": 833,
      "y2": 2395
    },
    "source_text": "I'M ASKING BECAUSE I\nTHINK YOU WOULD KNOW\nBETTER THAN I DO."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 55,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 10311,
    "id": "text_9c4ef6a7a6f54956",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 112,
      "y1": 756,
      "x2": 605,
      "y2": 944
    },
    "source_text": "EVA'S\nINSIGHT ISN'T USUALLY\nOUTSTANDING..."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 55,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 10601,
    "id": "text_337202bf31ba420d",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 358,
      "y1": 1046,
      "x2": 795,
      "y2": 1277
    },
    "source_text": "IS IT BECAUSE\nTHEY'RE A MARRIED\nCOUPLE?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 55,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 11596,
    "id": "text_85b58574efa04eec",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 115,
      "y1": 2041,
      "x2": 504,
      "y2": 2190
    },
    "source_text": "I DON'T KNOW\nEITHER."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 55,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 11789,
    "id": "text_607a90c12b1d488d",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 348,
      "y1": 2234,
      "x2": 791,
      "y2": 2479
    },
    "source_text": "BUT\nSTRICTLY SPEAKING,\nTHE PROBABILITY IS\nLOW."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 56,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 14332,
    "id": "text_ca874c2e0588486c",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 47,
      "y1": 2180,
      "x2": 517,
      "y2": 2359
    },
    "source_text": "IF THE WORST HAPPENS,\nDON'T WORRY ABOUT ME\nAND JUST ABANDON ME."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 56,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 14663,
    "id": "text_5587e048e7be4e57",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 302,
      "y1": 2511,
      "x2": 759,
      "y2": 2685
    },
    "source_text": "I DON'T HAVE\nTHE CONFIDENCE TO LIVE\nWITHOUT HIM ANYWAY."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 56,
    "source_page": 14,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 15357,
    "id": "text_40f94e5a41b54a98",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 3205,
      "x2": 569,
      "y2": 3431
    },
    "source_text": "FATHER'S\nREQUEST INCLUDED\nYOU AS WELL,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 57,
    "source_page": 15,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 542,
    "id": "text_e43e9a4488754cdf",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 362,
      "y1": 542,
      "x2": 671,
      "y2": 721
    },
    "source_text": "EV- NO,\nMOTHER."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 57,
    "source_page": 15,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 1352,
    "id": "text_af7f86e3909845f4",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 101,
      "y1": 1352,
      "x2": 526,
      "y2": 1552
    },
    "source_text": "LUKAIS, LET'S BE\nHONEST WITH EACH\nOTHER."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 57,
    "source_page": 15,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 2540,
    "id": "text_d2898ae9645c4286",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 196,
      "y1": 2540,
      "x2": 635,
      "y2": 2734
    },
    "source_text": "I DON'T THINK\nOF YOU AS MY SON\nANYWAY,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 57,
    "source_page": 15,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 2806,
    "id": "text_31f15637319349d7",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 469,
      "y1": 2806,
      "x2": 866,
      "y2": 2980
    },
    "source_text": "AND YOU DON'T\nCONSIDER ME YOUR\nMOTHER EITHER."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 58,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 600,
    "id": "text_aeb7d476074b484a",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 79,
      "y1": 600,
      "x2": 530,
      "y2": 757
    },
    "source_text": "BUT SINCE HEILLAS\nTRUSTS YOU,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 58,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 892,
    "id": "text_c6417921478944fd",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 323,
      "y1": 892,
      "x2": 809,
      "y2": 1090
    },
    "source_text": "YOU MUST BE THE ONLY\nONE WHO CAN PROTECT\nMY CHILDREN."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 58,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 1994,
    "id": "text_1e338a5da97347f3",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 460,
      "y1": 1994,
      "x2": 852,
      "y2": 2152
    },
    "source_text": "SO PLEASE,\nPROTECT THEM."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 59,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 2810,
    "id": "text_0a300c9d58104caf",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 133,
      "y1": 410,
      "x2": 506,
      "y2": 577
    },
    "source_text": "I INTEND TO\nDO SO."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 59,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 3032,
    "id": "text_e3c795bac2f6429a",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 389,
      "y1": 632,
      "x2": 761,
      "y2": 809
    },
    "source_text": "EVEN IF YOU\nDIDN'T ASK."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 59,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 1,
    "source_y": 4933,
    "id": "text_e17fdab0aa7e41a0",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 214,
      "y1": 2533,
      "x2": 690,
      "y2": 2724
    },
    "source_text": "YOU STILL DON'T\nUNDERSTAND WHAT I'M\nSAYING, LUKA."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 60,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 5895,
    "id": "text_ffb8f396310a44b7",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 82,
      "y1": 636,
      "x2": 605,
      "y2": 863
    },
    "source_text": "I'M SAYING THAT EVEN\nIF THE KUSTORIA FAMILY\nFALLS,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 61,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 6234,
    "id": "text_c294c72094144a2c",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 286,
      "y1": 790,
      "x2": 854,
      "y2": 944
    },
    "source_text": "AND EVEN IF MEMBERS\nOF OTHER FAMILIES DIE,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 61,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 7784,
    "id": "text_f28d0c5487cf4c53",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 75,
      "y1": 2340,
      "x2": 638,
      "y2": 2589
    },
    "source_text": "EVEN IF YOU HAVE TO\nTHROW AWAY YOUR DUTIES\nAND OBLIGATIONS AS\nACTING PATRIARCH,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 62,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 8174,
    "id": "text_52bca003e9174c9a",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 300,
      "y1": 910,
      "x2": 808,
      "y2": 1162
    },
    "source_text": "JUST PROTECT...\nMY CHILDREN AT\nTHE VERY LEAST."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 63,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 12063,
    "id": "text_manual_src16_eva_feels",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 52,
      "y1": 1179,
      "x2": 879,
      "y2": 1368
    },
    "source_text": "I KNOW EXACTLY HOW EVA FEELS AS SHE ASKS ME THIS."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 64,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 6,
    "source_y": 14623,
    "id": "text_d64f680724494340",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 57,
      "y1": 1657,
      "x2": 419,
      "y2": 1783
    },
    "source_text": "HOWEVER..."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 64,
    "source_page": 16,
    "slice_index": 6,
    "source_y": 14891,
    "id": "text_8b9b08b3cf9f4a84",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 228,
      "y1": 1925,
      "x2": 900,
      "y2": 2173
    },
    "source_text": "EVEN IF I WANTED TO\nGRANT THAT REQUEST,\nFOR ME,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 65,
    "source_page": 17,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 268,
    "id": "text_810a7bae98f841eb",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 230,
      "y1": 268,
      "x2": 669,
      "y2": 465
    },
    "source_text": "...I GUESS I'LL\nJUST HAVE TO HOPE\nHE SUCCEEDS."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 65,
    "source_page": 17,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 1997,
    "id": "text_9c975aee347e41e1",
    "semantic_type": "free_text",
    "region": {
      "x1": 84,
      "y1": 1997,
      "x2": 808,
      "y2": 2220
    },
    "source_text": "I DON'T HAVE A WAY\nTO DO SO."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 68,
    "source_page": 18,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 5684,
    "id": "text_841023fa08de486a",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 104,
      "y1": 256,
      "x2": 462,
      "y2": 376
    },
    "source_text": "AM I LATE..."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 68,
    "source_page": 18,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 7116,
    "id": "text_11e64b11e2ca4d3e",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 333,
      "y1": 1688,
      "x2": 757,
      "y2": 1875
    },
    "source_text": "OR AM I NOT\nLATE..."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 68,
    "source_page": 18,
    "slice_index": 2,
    "source_y": 7894,
    "id": "text_ea8d2ba708994691",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 228,
      "y1": 2466,
      "x2": 664,
      "y2": 2652
    },
    "source_text": "I NEED MORE\nOPTIONS."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 69,
    "source_page": 18,
    "slice_index": 3,
    "source_y": 10000,
    "id": "text_d311557af53549ff",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 212,
      "y1": 1290,
      "x2": 686,
      "y2": 1524
    },
    "source_text": "I MUST SEE\nNOEL MULIZKA'S\nCHOICE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 70,
    "source_page": 18,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 12360,
    "id": "text_c2a426ff453446a7",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 71,
      "y1": 482,
      "x2": 288,
      "y2": 588
    },
    "source_text": "LUKA!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 70,
    "source_page": 18,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 13913,
    "id": "text_d4d1d0a1296a42bd",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 256,
      "y1": 2035,
      "x2": 772,
      "y2": 2285
    },
    "source_text": "WHAT DID YOU\nCALL ME FOR-"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 70,
    "source_page": 18,
    "slice_index": 4,
    "source_y": 14096,
    "id": "text_4968bc2061b24920",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 527,
      "y1": 2218,
      "x2": 772,
      "y2": 2286
    },
    "source_text": "GISELLE,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 71,
    "source_page": 18,
    "slice_index": 5,
    "source_y": 14760,
    "id": "text_dcacdb80a5e442c8",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 102,
      "y1": 482,
      "x2": 528,
      "y2": 625
    },
    "source_text": "...I NEED TO\nCONTACT BARBARA."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 72,
    "source_page": 19,
    "slice_index": 0,
    "source_y": 664,
    "id": "text_f7baef50b5b04aa5",
    "semantic_type": "speech_bubble",
    "region": {
      "x1": 240,
      "y1": 664,
      "x2": 657,
      "y2": 884
    },
    "source_text": "I NEED\nYOUR HELP."
  }
]